<p>In subsequent years, I was married in the Cathedral; as were both my sisters 
on their first marriages. (Of course, all three of us chose other venues for our 
subsequent marriages.) But I still have fond memories of that great old building, 
still the spiritual focus of Catholics in St. Augustine.</p>

